---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { site } from '../data.mjs';
---
<Layout title="Enquiry Privacy Notice | Welltroy" description="How Welltroy's website handles packaging enquiries, contact details and attached artwork, and how to contact us about your information." canonicalPath="/privacy/">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><div class="breadcrumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> / Privacy Notice</div><p class="eyebrow">Your enquiry information</p><h1>Privacy Notice</h1><p class="lead">This notice explains the information you share through the Welltroy packaging enquiry form.</p><p>Updated 24 October 2026</p></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container policy-content">
    <h2>Who to Contact</h2><p>{site.legalName}<br />{site.address}<br /><a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a></p>
    <h2>What the Form Collects</h2><p>The form asks for your name, email, product, estimated quantity and destination. Company, WhatsApp number, size, sample preference, requirements and artwork files are optional, except that assisted enquiries need a description of what you want to pack.</p><p>Only include information and artwork needed to discuss your packaging. Do not send payment-card details, identity documents or unrelated personal information.</p>
    <h2>How Your Enquiry Is Handled</h2><p>The form sends your details and selected files to Welltroy's enquiry email address so the team can respond and prepare a quotation. Files are sent as email attachments; this form does not publish them in a public website folder. If you require a confidentiality agreement for artwork, contact us before sending the files.</p>
    <h2>Website and Email Providers</h2><p>Cloudflare serves the website and provides the Turnstile security check, which processes browser and connection information to help prevent abuse. Enquiries are sent through Tencent enterprise email. These services process information needed to deliver the website, security check and email.</p><p><a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Cloudflare Privacy Policy ↗</a></p><p>If you choose WhatsApp or your email application, that service handles your message under its own privacy terms.</p>
    <h2 id="website-analytics">Optional Website Analytics</h2><p>When Google Analytics is enabled for this website, we ask for your choice before loading it. If you allow analytics, Google Analytics cookies help measure page and product visits, enquiry starts and submission results, clicks to quote buttons, catalogue downloads, catalogue size selections, sample preferences, and clicks to email or WhatsApp. Declining does not prevent you from browsing or sending an enquiry.</p><p>Our custom analytics events use catalogue product identifiers, recognised page paths and broad event categories. They do not include your form contact details, company name, message, enquiry reference, artwork, file names or attachment contents. We remove query strings and fragments from the page addresses sent by this integration. After you allow analytics, a fixed list of public campaign source, medium and product-campaign labels can be sent separately to identify marketing visits. Unrecognised labels, search terms, advertising click IDs and other URL parameters are not included by this integration. These public campaign labels are remembered in this browser tab for up to 30 minutes to connect product browsing with an enquiry. Declining or withdrawing analytics clears this campaign record. Google Analytics also processes browser and device information for measurement. For recognised public search, social and AI services, this integration sends the referring service origin only, without conversation paths, search terms, query strings or fragments. Other referring origins are withheld. Analytics is separate from your enquiry email.</p><p>We remember your analytics choice in this browser for up to 180 days. Use “Analytics preferences” in the footer to change it. If you withdraw consent after Google Analytics has loaded, the page reloads to stop it and clears the known Google Analytics cookies this site can access. Already transmitted data is not erased by withdrawal; contact us with any data request. If the preferences control is not shown, this integration is not enabled on the current host.</p><p><a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Privacy Policy ↗</a></p>
    <h2>Retention, Corrections and Deletion Requests</h2><p>Your submitted enquiry and attachments become email correspondence. Contact <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> to ask about retention, correct your details, or request deletion. Include your enquiry reference if available, and use the email address supplied with the enquiry where possible so the relevant record can be located. Any order-record obligations or other retention requirements can be explained in response to your request.</p>
    <h2>Before You Submit</h2><p>You can change the form fields or remove selected attachments before sending. If a submission cannot be confirmed, contact us before sending it again to avoid a duplicate enquiry.</p><a class="button" href="/quote/#quote-form">Return to the enquiry form</a>
  </div></section>
</Layout>
